Package: JEL
Title: Jointly Estimated Landmarking for Dynamic Prediction
Version: 2.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Jinwoo", "Cho", , "jinoojwcho@pitt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Jointly Estimated Landmarking (JEL) methods for dynamic prediction using longitudinal and survival data. Supports models with time-varying coefficients and multiple longitudinal processes with a fast EM algorithm. For detailed methodology, refer to Jinwoo Cho and Kehui Chen, ''Dynamic Prediction of Survival Outcomes Using Jointly Estimated Landmarking Approach."
